          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Why you should be on X:  You can see real-time supply-chain information shared directly by Korean semiconductor engineers, for free.  You get raw, unfiltered information without it going through sell-side analysts or research houses.  This is why I don’t use Reddit or other",
          "url": "https://x.com/jukan05/status/2063860067649380675",
